# A99 TeraDesk (sd-tera, #Z autorun): hover the "View" title (133,8) -> drop-down;
# onto "Set mask..." (200,266); click -> the SETMASK dialog (tree 9: FTYPE1..4
# non-3D G_FTEXT rows, te_color 0x1100, SELECTABLE|RBUTTON|TOUCHEXIT, on the
# FL3DBAK box FTPARENT; FTYPE1 pre-selected by xd_set_rbutton). Rows are 16 px:
# FTYPE1 y 209..224, FTYPE2 225..240, FTYPE3 241..256 (A85 measured row 1 at
# 320..415 x 209..224). Click row 1 (already selected), row 2, row 3; park the
# pointer bottom-right before every dump. `arm` switches the H02 serial AES
# trace on before the row clicks, so the serial log shows the opcode path
# (47 objc_change per row, then TeraDesk's 42 objc_draw of FTPARENT).
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 133 8
1800 move 200 266
2300 mark B_VIEW_OPEN
2500 down
2503 up
3500 parkbr
4200 mark C_SETMASK_DIALOG
4300 arm
4500 move 350 216
4900 down
4903 up
5300 parkbr
5900 mark D_ROW1_CLICKED
6200 move 350 232
6600 down
6603 up
7000 parkbr
7600 mark E_ROW2_CLICKED
7900 move 350 248
8300 down
8303 up
8700 parkbr
9300 mark F_ROW3_CLICKED
